# One-tap care-team sync (optional; OFF until both are set).
# Create a NEW dedicated Supabase project (never an existing one), run
# supabase/migrations/0001_journey_sync.sql in its SQL editor, then set:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SYNC_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SYNC_ANON_KEY=<anon public key>
# Read docs/HIPAA-BRIEF.md before enabling for real patients (BAA required).
